{"id":"fianc_ailles","lemma":"fiançailles","pos":"noun","rank":3087,"glosses":["engagement (before a marriage); betrothal"],"ipa":"/fjɑ̃.saj/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/Fr-fian%C3%A7ailles.ogg/Fr-fian%C3%A7ailles.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","examples":[{"text":"J'ai rompu nos fiançailles.","en":"I've broken off our engagement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"broken"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},null]},{"text":"Ils ont rompu leurs fiançailles.","en":"They broke off their engagement.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"broken"},{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null]},{"text":"Elle lui annonça ses fiançailles.","en":"She announced her engagement to him.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"to announce","l":"annoncer"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Ses parents approuvent les fiançailles.","en":"His parents approve of the engagement.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"relative","l":"parent"},{"g":"to approve of","l":"approuver"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Je vous félicite pour vos fiançailles.","en":"I congratulate you on your engagement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to congratulate","l":"féliciter"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null]}]}